    {
      "id": "tt39848811:1:1",
      "title": "Episode 1",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "released": "2025-12-15T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Zeba is a dedicated and bright young woman standing at the crossroads between education, family expectations, and destiny. As she prepares for her final exams, her loving but traditional household revolves around routine, faith, and quiet sacrifices. A joyful celebration at her friend Shani’s wedding introduces Zeba to an unexpected moment that will change everything. Amid laughter, music, and social gatherings, a mysterious encounter involving a lost earring sparks curiosity and fate quietly intervenes. What begins as an innocent evening slowly plants the seed of a future Zeba never anticipated, setting the tone for a journey where love, choice, and destiny collide.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt39848811/1/1/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 6766246
    },
    {
      "id": "tt39848811:1:2",
      "title": "Episode 2",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 2,
      "number": 2,
      "released": "2025-12-16T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Zeba struggles to understand the meaning behind the mysterious encounter that lingers in her thoughts. While her family moves swiftly toward arranging her future, emotions she never expected begin to surface. As a marriage proposal emerges suddenly, Zeba finds herself caught between obedience and confusion. The pace of events leaves little room for reflection, and questions about choice, destiny, and identity grow louder.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt39848811/1/2/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 6831386
    },
    {
      "id": "tt39848811:1:3",
      "title": "Episode 3",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 3,
      "number": 3,
      "released": "2025-12-22T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Zeba begins her new life as a married woman, surrounded by warmth, rituals, and expectations that come with entering an influential household. While the family showers her with affection, subtle cracks start to appear beneath the surface. A hurried marriage, unspoken fears, and an unexpected emotional attachment begin to weigh heavily on Zeba’s heart. As discussions of dowry and future alliances unfold, Zeba finds herself trapped between duty, guilt, and feelings she is desperately trying to suppress.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt39848811/1/3/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 6831388
    },
    {
      "id": "tt39848811:1:4",
      "title": "Episode 4",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 4,
      "number": 4,
      "released": "2025-12-23T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "As tensions rise, Zeba becomes increasingly aware of the power dynamics within her new home. A misunderstanding over dowry escalates into conflict, placing Zeba in an uncomfortable position between her parents and her in-laws. Meanwhile, revelations about Jami’s life and responsibilities shake her sense of security. Torn between obedience and self-respect, Zeba must confront the consequences of silence and the cost of preserving appearances.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt39848811/1/4/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 6831393
    },
    {
      "id": "tt39848811:1:5",
      "title": "Episode 5",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 5,
      "number": 5,
      "released": "2025-12-29T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "During their honeymoon, Zeba begins to notice troubling cracks in Jami’s behavior. What starts as small discomforts soon turn into financial tension, emotional pressure, and controlling attitudes. A fabricated story about a stolen wallet forces Zeba to ask her father for money, planting the first seeds of shame and mistrust. As appearances are maintained on the surface, an uneasy truth quietly begins to emerge beneath the marriage.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt39848811/1/5/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 6831401
    },
    {
      "id": "tt39848811:1:6",
      "title": "Episode 6",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 6,
      "number": 6,
      "released": "2025-12-30T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Back home, Zeba faces growing tension within her in-laws’ household, while Jami’s financial troubles slowly come to light. Humiliation, secrecy, and constant reminders of money deepen the cracks in their marriage. Meanwhile, Zeba’s parents begin to uncover unsettling truths about Jami’s business dealings, raising serious doubts about the man they trusted with their daughter’s future.",
